{"id":"eigentlich","lemma":"eigentlich","pos":"adv","rank":238,"glosses":["really, actually, in truth (with that description being the more pertinent one)","technically, strictly speaking, officially (with that description being secondary to some de-facto practice)","Used to introduce a question primarily driven by curiosity that might only be loosely if at all connected to the previous topic"],"ipa":"/ˈaɪ̯ɡəntlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/89/De-eigentlich.ogg/De-eigentlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Eigentlich habe ich keine Waffe.","en":"I don't really have a gun.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760942","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"weapon, arm"}]},{"text":"Wer würde dir eigentlich glauben?","en":"Who'd believe you anyway?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760167","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"dignity"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"to believe something"}]},{"text":"Eigentlich will uns niemand.","en":"Nobody really wants us.","words":[null,{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"nobody, no one"}]},{"text":"Was ist eigentlich passiert?","en":"What actually happened?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760263","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Wie alt bist du eigentlich?","en":"By the way, how old are you?","words":[null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,4,"how old are you"]]}]}